WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:01.918
Now let us focus more closely on

00:00:01.945 --> 00:00:05.066
methods and the word self An attribute

00:00:05.079 --> 00:00:08.158
is data stored inside an object For

00:00:08.171 --> 00:00:10.553
example self dot price stores a price

00:00:10.579 --> 00:00:13.408
that belongs to the current object A

00:00:13.421 --> 00:00:15.289
method is a function that belongs to

00:00:15.316 --> 00:00:18.539
a class For example a method named

00:00:18.566 --> 00:00:22.026
total might multiply price by quantity The

00:00:22.053 --> 00:00:24.197
word self refers to the current object

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:27.132
that is using the method Suppose we

00:00:27.158 --> 00:00:30.579
have two Sale objects One sale contains

00:00:30.592 --> 00:00:32.408
a notebook with a quantity of four

00:00:33.342 --> 00:00:35.289
Another sale contains a pen with a

00:00:35.303 --> 00:00:38.013
quantity of ten When we call the

00:00:38.026 --> 00:00:40.237
total method on the notebook sale self

00:00:40.263 --> 00:00:43.303
refers to the notebook sale object When

00:00:43.316 --> 00:00:44.645
we call the same method on the

00:00:44.671 --> 00:00:46.763
pen sale self refers to the pen

00:00:46.776 --> 00:00:49.789
sale object This is why one method

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:52.789
can work with many different objects The

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:55.474
method definition is shared but self connects

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.895
the calculation to the correct object's data

00:00:58.803 --> 00:01:02.408
At first self may feel unusual A

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:04.355
useful way to read self dot price

00:01:04.368 --> 00:01:07.500
is this object's price Read self dot

00:01:07.526 --> 00:01:10.803
quantity as this object's quantity When you

00:01:10.829 --> 00:01:12.447
see a method such as total with

00:01:12.474 --> 00:01:14.289
self inside it think of the method

00:01:14.316 --> 00:01:16.250
as saying use the values stored in

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:19.355
this particular object You will see this

00:01:19.382 --> 00:01:21.553
idea again in the next code example
